# ── School records ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The source documents carry pupils' names, staff salaries and staff BANK
# ACCOUNT NUMBERS. Git history is permanent and awkward to redact, so these
# stay out of it — keep them in the school's own storage.
*.doc
*.docx

# Collection sheets are generated by scripts/import/build-templates.js and will
# hold guardian emails and phone numbers once the office fills them in. The
# generator is tracked; its output is not.
scripts/import/templates/*.csv
